Here's the CSS code snippet to fix the 'Proceed to Checkout' button alignment issue on mobile devices:

```css
@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
  .woocommerce-checkout-actions {
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    float: none;
    clear: both;
  }

  .woocommerce-checkout-actions .button {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
  }
}
```

